#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:34
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Calendario"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:38
msgid "Months:"
msgstr "Meses:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:39
msgctxt "how many months are shown"
msgid "one — the current"
msgstr "uno — el actual"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:40
msgctxt "how many months are shown"
msgid "three — the previous, the current and the next"
msgstr "tres — el anterior, el actual y el siguiente"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:47
msgid "Week numbers:"
msgstr "Números de semana:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:48
msgid "ISO week numbers in front of the rows"
msgstr "números de semana ISO delante de las filas"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:53
msgid "Week starts on:"
msgstr "Inicio de la semana:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:54
msgctxt "first day of the week"
msgid "as the locale says"
msgstr "según la configuración regional"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:55
msgctxt "first day of the week"
msgid "Monday"
msgstr "lunes"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:56
msgctxt "first day of the week"
msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "domingo"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:63
msgid "Weekends:"
msgstr "Fines de semana:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:64
msgid "in their own colour, as on a wall calendar"
msgstr "en su propio color, como en un calendario de pared"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:69
msgid "Other months:"
msgstr "Otros meses:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:70
msgid "fill the empty cells with the neighbouring months' days"
msgstr "rellenar las celdas vacías con los días de los meses vecinos"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:74
msgid ""
"Today is in brackets. The names of the days and months, the first day\n"
"of the week and the weekend come from the locale\n"
"(System Settings → Language and Region → Formats)."
msgstr ""
"El día de hoy va entre corchetes. Los nombres de los días y los meses, el "
"primer\n"
"día de la semana y el fin de semana vienen de la configuración regional\n"
"(Preferencias del sistema → Idioma y región → Formatos)."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:79
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Texto"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:83
msgid "Font:"
msgstr "Tipo de letra:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:89
msgctxt "font size"
msgid "Size:"
msgstr "Tamaño:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:96
msgid "Day cell, characters:"
msgstr "Celda del día, caracteres:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:102
msgid ""
"The widget is as wide as seven cells and the week numbers, and as tall as\n"
"the months shown: eight lines each, with a blank line between them."
msgstr ""
"El widget es tan ancho como siete celdas y los números de semana, y tan "
"alto\n"
"como los meses mostrados: ocho líneas cada uno, con una línea en blanco "
"entre ellos."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:107
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "Paleta"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:110
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Main text:"
msgstr "Texto principal:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:116
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Weekends:"
msgstr "Fines de semana:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:122
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Secondary:"
msgstr "Secundario:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:128
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Today:"
msgstr "Hoy:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:19
msgid "Mouse:"
msgstr "Ratón:"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:20
msgid "let clicks through to the desktop"
msgstr "dejar pasar los clics al escritorio"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:24
msgid ""
"While clicks go through, both mouse buttons land on the desktop.\n"
"The widget takes the mouse only in the desktop's edit mode:\n"
"that is where its settings are, or ./install.sh with the clicks off "
"switch."
msgstr ""
"Mientras los clics pasan de largo, ambos botones del ratón llegan al "
"escritorio.\n"
"El widget solo toma el ratón en el modo de edición del escritorio:\n"
"ahí está su configuración, o ./install.sh con la opción clicks off."
